{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119569","id":3708313180,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7dCF5c","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119569","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119569.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119569.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119569","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119569/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119569/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119569/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bce446c75f294fcf36d20198e2b92ee9606a25a4","number":119569,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix SoftBody3D pinned_points editing bugs","user":{"login":"Vaidehii28","id":89007463,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDA3NDYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89007463?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28","html_url":"https://github.com/Vaidehii28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Editing the `pinned_points` array of a SoftBody3D triggered three bugs:\r\n\r\n1. Increasing the last element deleted the pin and printed \"Invalid index for pin point insertion position.\" The insertion-position guard in `pin_point()` rejected `p_insert_at == pinned_points.size()`, even though `Vector::insert` accepts a position in `[0, size()]` (inserting at `size()` is a valid append). Changed `>=` to `>`.\r\n\r\n2/3. `_set_property_pinned_points_indices()` grabbed `pinned_points.ptrw()`\r\n   once and then called `pin_point()`, which mutates `pinned_points` via\r\n   `remove_at()`/`insert()` mid-loop, invalidating the pointer and changing\r\n   `size()`. It also overloaded `-1` as a sentinel, so a user-typed `-1` was\r\n   forwarded to the physics server (Jolt then reported it out of bounds every\r\n   step) and was never unpinned when corrected, leaving a stale error state.\r\n\r\nRewrote `_set_property_pinned_points_indices()` to snapshot the old list and rebuild in a single pass, calling only `_pin_point_on_physics_server()` (which never touches `pinned_points`). Removed points are unpinned by comparing the old and new index lists; negative indices are never sent to the physics server. Attachment/offset data is preserved for points that stay pinned.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-05-19T10:51:59Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T10:53:58Z","closed_at":"2026-05-19T10:53:50Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"d06aa1ab2b138835b6332c981e9ffc8425fa7fd3","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Vaidehii28:fix-softbody3d-pinned-points","ref":"fix-softbody3d-pinned-points","repo":{"id":1243426867,"node_id":"R_kgDOSh0wMw","name":"godot","full_name":"Vaidehii28/godot","owner":{"login":"Vaidehii28","id":89007463,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MDA3NDYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89007463?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28","html_url":"https://github.com/Vaidehii28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vaidehii28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"